0<sup>ox</sup>%, respectively.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJAD2010-761571.002"/></fig><fig id="fig3" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>Receiver operator curves for differentiating DLB from PDD using A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>42/tau, A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>1&#x02013;42% and A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>1&#x02013;40<sup>ox</sup>%, respectively.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="IJAD2010-761571.003"/></fig><table-wrap id="tab1" position="float"><label>Table 1</label><caption><p>Age, MMSE, Total tau, A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>42, A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>1&#x02013;42%, and A<italic>&#x003b2;</italic>1&#x02013;40<sup><italic>o</italic><italic>x</italic></sup>% in the CSF of the diagnostic groups.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><th align="left" rowspan="2" colspan="1">Diagnosis</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">NDC (<italic>n</italic> = 40)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">AD (<italic>n</italic> = 45)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">DLB (<italic>n</italic> = 15)</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">PDD (<italic>n</italic> = 21)</th></tr><tr><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">mean &#x000b1; SD</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">mean &#x000b1; SD</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">mean &#x000b1; SD</th><th align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">mean &#x000b1; SD </th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">Age</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">64.5 &#x000b1; 9.3</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">70.9 &#x000b1; 9.2</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">71.4 &#x000b1; 7.6</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">73.2 &#x000b1; 7.2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" rowspan="1" colspan="1">MMSE</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">28.6 &#x000b1; 1.4</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">19.4 &#x000b1; 5.8</td><td align="center" rowspan="1" colspan="1">19.2